e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DWT7P4TcAocQ7kNvwGqdGNH&_nc_oc=AdqGEo3UVoWFZSsbjQ4q4fONMJQg4aQzv9d6bNpPTSZAgB0IlXco4q9AIHo_kdpeGSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOsK3prHrJxENzFqQu22NNxAjGVPkQBDMBDOkoMYnp-eg&oe=6AC644AD"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TwkAg2dE5ikQ7kNvwEU2bK3&_nc_oc=AdoaCivwBMmbxnBPHjTIjN7pgD5nCliisM3kt8OBiugo39rZm1WKzGKEW9g5HR2CUyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNr5bB7LKJ2HB7Hf8fPzT4o6eNM2MoE3k8bdUl-GMSJKQ&oe=6AC6734F"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K6QFODHf5u0Q7kNvwHOEXLK&_nc_oc=Adq1zv8HWCD4EJGdY7zQ1MW4oXK_5l3zPv6snjglOFUh81RxxOvLQBJqWZII5gVPKkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtDBS58eeIYN-0e1DPEClqCbUVa-HFLy4sbDwpkzz5RQ&oe=6AC63EBC"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QpDzR4lfqZsQ7kNvwG-UlsR&_nc_oc=AdooMH_7TzBOevmKM1YQxs_qfuEIrQvYdu2DUc6kVEgwkqSP_KAtyYB1s4oShgz4vgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMnJSXDXn9eCemf6utlPEeps9fsKhtlL6hmM5OYr6ZoaA&oe=6AC648CC"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lWeziIsr-4Q7kNvwFn4rkR&_nc_oc=AdqMvy5h-fxVHfPLCWVWZAXGPAQVwxW52XnQtALrp7Is-JzDVVZI5eZcvcDeS8pzEiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVo-U7Nd9vGof8v5cIITEHMGJcyNu9gaOtHd3byMND7w&oe=6AC67213"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n